{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、走れ!Bicycle発売記念握手会\n全日程が終了しましたー!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いに来て下さった皆様\n本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/0058967/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/0058967/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３rd握手会では、\n今までよりも沢山の方にお会いすることが出来ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様のおかげで\nとっても楽しい時間を過ごすことができました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ゆみ姉 お疲れ様★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のゆみ姉の挨拶には、\n涙が堪えられませんでした..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラスト 似顔絵会!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒に、\nアバターゆみこ書こーね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/0058967/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/0058967/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の洋服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/0058967/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/0058967/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/0058967/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シンプルなモノトーン系"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/0058967/0006.gif","alt":""},